  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_musk_cb123d8db112c7a024029eeb1d81399cd885b69e672e8f316245c11cdf45c419d18">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>musk, an odoriferous, reddish-brown substance, secreted in a gland or sack by the male musk-deer; has a very powerful and enduring odor and is used as the basis of many perfumes, as well as in medicine (OED s.v. musk)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
